  "id": 8860132835527,
  "title": "I Am Who He Says I Am Christian Scripture Blanket – Inspirational",
  "handle": "i-am-who-he-says-i-am-christian-scripture-blanket-inspirational",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace faith and comfort with this personalized Christian blanket from Jeminise, designed to bring warmth and daily encouragement. Adorned with uplifting bible verses, this blanket makes a heartfelt keepsake and an inspirational gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Faith &amp; Comfort Design:</strong> Blends soft, skin-friendly fleece with scripture for warmth, peace, and daily encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized with Love:</strong> Add a name or date to create a one-of-a-kind Jesus Christ blanket, perfect for cherished inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Cozy Fabric:</strong> Features soft, skin-friendly fabric and uplifting verses for a comforting experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 30x40, 50x60, or 60x80 inches to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inspirational Gift:</strong> An ideal religious throw blanket for women and girls, suitable for birthdays, Christmas, or baptisms.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and air dry, microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Special Feature:</strong> Customizable and lightweight, offering both personal touch and comfort.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>D14</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas, Religious</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>butterflies, floral, cloud, cross</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>40\"L x 30\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>S/M/L/XL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Customizable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
